  "edge_schema": "voltmarkt_edge_pat",
  "prompt": "For each Voltmarkt store (stores.store_code), how many orders did it take in 2024 and in 2025? order_ts holds UTC time: put each order in the year of its UTC day. Return three columns, in this order: store_code, orders_2024 and orders_2025. A year in which a store took no orders shows 0. Return one row for each store with orders in either year. Any row order is fine.",
